  "aboutDmxPageTitle": "DMX — operation (simple & complete)",
  "aboutDmxSummaryLine1": "DMX = RS-485, 512 channels (slots) per universe, values 0–255 (8-bit).",
  "aboutDmxSummaryLine2": "Timing: 250 kbaud, full universe ≈ ~44 Hz (order of magnitude).",
  "aboutDmxSummaryLine3": "Topology: daisy-chain (no passive Y). 120Ω termination on the last device.",
  "aboutDmxSummaryLine4": "RDM = bidirectional DMX (config/monitoring) → splitter/node compatibility must be checked.",
  "aboutDmxSummaryLine5": "Art-Net / sACN = DMX universes transported over Ethernet/IP via nodes.",
  "aboutDmxSummaryLine6": "sACN = multicast + priorities (IGMP snooping recommended).",
