  "aboutNetworkToc2": "2) IP plan (simple)",
  "aboutNetworkToc3": "3) VLAN (segmentation)",
  "aboutNetworkToc4": "4) IGMP (sACN multicast)",
  "aboutNetworkToc5": "5) Wi-Fi vs wired",
