  "aboutSacnSection6SubBullet1": "Stabilize DMX without RDM.",
  "aboutSacnSection6SubBullet2": "Test RDM on a simple, clean line.",
  "aboutSacnSection6SubBullet3": "If issues: disable RDM, then isolate node/splitter.",

