  "aboutVideoSummaryCopy": "VIDEO — field reference\n• Resolution = size (px). FPS = smoothness / latency.\n• 4:2:2 / 4:4:4 + 10-bit = color quality.\n• SDI = robust + long distance.\n• HDMI = fragile + short.\n• NDI = IP (network), depends on the LAN.\n• Genlock / Timecode = sync.",
